// Copy this file to Config/Secrets.xcconfig (gitignored) and fill in your own values.
// The app builds and runs without this file; the Support screen just reports that tipping is unavailable.
//
// RevenueCat public SDK key for the iOS app, from the RevenueCat dashboard under Project settings, API keys.
// A value that still starts with REPLACE_ is treated as "no key". You can also set REVENUECAT_API_KEY as an
// environment variable on the Xcode scheme instead.
REVENUECAT_API_KEY = REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_REVENUECAT_PUBLIC_SDK_KEY
